<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>My Safe Space</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Supportive, compassionate guidance for healing, mentoring, and abuse recovery." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7f1ec;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --panel-soft: #f1e7df;
      --main: #7a4b3a;
      --main-dark: #4d2d23;
      --text: #2c211d;
      --muted: #685b56;
      --line: #e5d7ce;
      --accent: #c68b75;
      --shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(61, 39, 30, 0.08);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .topbar {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 72px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--main-dark);
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 22px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--main);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: var(--main-dark);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--main);
      border: 2px solid var(--main);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: var(--panel-soft);
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7f1ec 0%, #efe3d9 100%);
      padding: 80px 0 70px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--main);
      background: #f2e4dc;
      border: 1px solid #e8d7ce;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin: 18px 0 18px;
      color: var(--main-dark);
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .hero-card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .hero-card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--main-dark);
    }

    .stat-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .stat-list li {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 76px 0;
    }

    .section-header {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      color: var(--main-dark);
    }

    .section-header p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-box {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .about-box p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .info-card {
      background: var(--panel-soft);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    .info-card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--main-dark);
    }

    .info-card ul {
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .card .icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--panel-soft);
      border-radius: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--main-dark);
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .resource-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .resource-item {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .resource-body {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .resource-body h3 {
      color: var(--main-dark);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .resource-body p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .resource-link {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--main);
    }

    .newsletter-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .news-item {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--main);
      background: #f2e4dc;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .news-item h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--main-dark);
    }

    .news-item p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .contact-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #f5eae1 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 34px 28px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .contact-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--main-dark);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.3rem);
    }

    .contact-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    footer {
      background: #2d221f;
      color: #f4ece8;
      padding: 28px 0;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .footer-wrap {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .footer-wrap p {
      margin: 0;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .about-grid,
      .cards,
      .resource-grid,
      .newsletter-list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .nav {
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 16px 0;
      }

      .nav-links {
        justify-content: center;
        padding-top: 8px;
      }

      .contact-box {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="container nav">
      <div class="brand">My Safe Space</div>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#resources">Resources</a>
        <a href="#newsletter">Newsletter</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Compassionate support</span>
          <h1>Safe, supportive guidance for healing and growth.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            My Safe Space offers compassionate, trauma-aware support through psychology-informed guidance,
            peer mentoring, and practical recovery resources.
          </p>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="#resources" class="btn">Explore resources</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Get in touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3>What you can access</h3>
          <ul class="stat-list">
            <li><span>Abuse recovery guidance</span><strong>✓</strong></li>
            <li><span>Peer mentoring support</span><strong>✓</strong></li>
            <li><span>Wellbeing resources</span><strong>✓</strong></li>
            <li><span>Digital guides & newsletter</span><strong>✓</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>About My Safe Space</h2>
          <p>
            A supportive, compassionate space rooted in lived experience, dignity, and gentle guidance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="about-box">
            <p>
              My Safe Space is a supportive environment for those navigating difficult life experiences,
              emotional recovery, and the process of rebuilding trust, confidence, and stability.
              The focus is on compassionate connection, practical support, and safe encouragement.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="info-card">
            <h3>Who this is for</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>People healing from abuse or trauma</li>
              <li>Anyone seeking emotional support and grounding</li>
              <li>People exploring mentoring, guidance, and recovery pathways</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Support and services</h2>
          <p>Practical, compassionate pathways to healing and resilience.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">💛</div>
            <h3>Abuse recovery</h3>
            <p>Gentle support, reflective guidance, and tools to help rebuild safety and confidence.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">🫶</div>
            <h3>Peer mentoring</h3>
            <p>Encouraging, non-judgmental guidance for people seeking support on their healing journey.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">📘</div>
            <h3>Digital guides</h3>
            <p>Downloadable resources that explore trauma-informed practices, reflection, and recovery.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="resources">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Digital guides and downloads</h2>
          <p>Download practical tools and resources designed for support and reflection.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="resource-grid">
          <article class="resource-item">
            <div class="resource-body">
              <h3>Abuse Recovery Guide</h3>
              <p>A supportive guide for understanding recovery, grounding techniques, and next steps.</p>
              <a class="resource-link" href="assets/pdfs/abuse-recovery-guide.pdf" target="_blank" download>Download PDF</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="resource-item">
            <div class="resource-body">
              <h3>Mentoring Resource Pack</h3>
              <p>Helpful prompts and simple tools to support healthy conversations and reflection.</p>
              <a class="resource-link" href="assets/pdfs/mentoring-resource-pack.pdf" target="_blank" download>Download PDF</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="resource-item">
            <div class="resource-body">
              <h3>Newsletter Archive</h3>
              <p>Past writing, updates, and wellbeing reflections shared through the My Safe Space newsletter.</p>
              <a class="resource-link" href="assets/pdfs/newsletter-archive.pdf" target="_blank" download>Download PDF</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="newsletter">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Newsletter and updates</h2>
          <p>Monthly reflections, resources, and practical support for emotional wellbeing.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="newsletter-list">
          <article class="news-item">
            <span class="tag">Wellbeing</span>
            <h3>Finding steadiness after overwhelm</h3>
            <p>Simple grounding tools and gentle steps toward emotional calm.</p>
            <a href="assets/pdfs/newsletter-archive.pdf" class="resource-link" target="_blank" download>Read PDF</a>
          </article>

          <article class="news-item">
            <span class="tag">Recovery</span>
            <h3>Understanding boundaries with compassion</h3>
            <p>How boundaries can protect wellbeing without shame or guilt.</p>
            <a href="assets/pdfs/newsletter-archive.pdf" class="resource-link" target="_blank" download>Read PDF</a>
          </article>

          <article class="news-item">
            <span class="tag">Mentoring</span>
            <h3>Reflection prompts for healing</h3>
            <p>Thoughtful questions to support insight, awareness, and self-kindness.</p>
            <a href="assets/pdfs/newsletter-archive.pdf" class="resource-link" target="_blank" download>Read PDF</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="contact-box">
          <div>
            <h3>Need support or guidance?</h3>
            <p>Reach out to begin a safe, compassionate conversation.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@mysafespace.com">Contact by email</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-wrap">
      <p>© 2026 My Safe Space</p>
      <p>Compassionate support for healing and growth.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
